                "message": "docs: Minor corrections in Swedish translation.\n\n\"Manual\" here isn't the handbook, it's about \"auto-accepting\" (or not)\nfiles. \"pending\" here was translated to avvaktar, which feels a bit more\nactive/anxious/hesitant than the pending message context here.",
